{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13008","headline":"奉和中书常舍人晚秋集贤院即事寄赠徐薛二侍御 · 独孤及","name":"奉和中书常舍人晚秋集贤院即事寄赠徐薛二侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家金马署，帝座紫微郎。\n图籍淩羣玉，歌诗冠柏梁。\n阴阴万年树，肃肃五经堂。\n挥翰忘朝食，研精待夕阳。\n晴空露盘迥，秋月琐窗凉。\n远兴生斑鬓，高情寄缥囊。\n葳蕤双鸑鷟，夙昔并翱翔。\n汲冢同刊谬，蓬山共补亡。\n差池摧羽翮，流落限江湘。\n禁省一分袂，昊天三雨霜。\n石渠遗迹满，水国暮云长。\n早晚朝宣室，归时道路光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}